{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-7088026718121230605"},"published":{"$t":"2013-09-18T12:49:00.000+02:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2013-09-18T12:54:44.221+02:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Gorazd Petresovicz: Zámčisko"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<br />\n<br />\nGorazd Petresovicz poskytol pre našu stránku túto skvelú poéziu - báseň o hradisku<a href=\"http://www.hradiska.sk/search/label/Z%C3%A1m%C4%8Disko%20-%20Modra\"> Zámčisko (pri Modre).</a> Ďakujeme!<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<i><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Zámčisko</b><br /> <br />nad mestom sa vypína,<br />hora krásna visutá,<br />a v tej hore horičke,<br />aj Ty kráčaš si po cestičke,</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></i>\n<div>\n<i><span style=\"font-size: large;\">zrazu vítajú Ťa hradieb skaliská,<br />tie pozostatky Zámčiska,<br />Matka Zem ich pre nás chráni,<br />prikrývkou pôdy tajomstvo predkov bráni,</span></i></div>\n<div>\n<i><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tajomstvo národa v sláve slova<br />národ, ktorý už dosť má boja,</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br />predkovia naši zhynuli tu pred časom v boji,<br />tu kde Láska k predkom, potomkov spoluprácou znovu v sile spojí<br />bez zbraní a bez boja<br />prácou krásu obnovia</span></i><br />\n<br />\n<br /></div>\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/feeds/7088026718121230605/comments/default","title":"Zverejniť komentáre"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2013/09/gorazd-petresovicz-zamcisko.html#comment-form","title":"0 komentárov"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/7088026718121230605"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/7088026718121230605"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2013/09/gorazd-petresovicz-zamcisko.html","title":"Gorazd Petresovicz: Zámčisko"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}]}}